# 默认让 Git 自行识别文本/二进制，不做强制换行转换
* text=auto

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析会出错
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源：禁止 diff / 禁止换行处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.sqlite binary

# 文档与源码在 diff 里显示为文本
*.md text
*.mjs text
*.js text
*.css text
*.html text
*.json text
